# sample-basic.chordpro
# A plain ChordPro file — no KeyPro directives.
# This file demonstrates that all valid .chordpro files are valid KeyPro documents.
# Open this in any ChordPro-compatible app (OnSong, ChordPro reference app, etc.)
# and it will render correctly. Open it in a KeyPro app and it renders identically.
#
# Song: Wonderful Tonight — Eric Clapton
# Genre: English classic rock ballad
# This is the kind of chart a keyboard player would bring to a covers gig.

{title: Wonderful Tonight}
{artist: Eric Clapton}
{key: G}
{tempo: 96}

{comment: Intro}
[G] [D] [C] [D]

{comment: Verse 1}
It's [G]late in the even[D]ing,
she's [C]wondering what clothes to [D]wear

She [G]puts on her make[D]up
and [C]brushes her long blonde [D]hair

And then she [C]asks me,
[D]do I look all[G]right? [Em]

And I say [C]yes, you look [D]wonderful to[G]night [D]

